                  \\underset{\underset{\epsilon\to 0}{\longrightarrow}}{\lim}
                  \\int_{\mathbb{R}^{d}/\mathbb{Z}^{d}}
                  \\int \mathrm{d}^d \vec x
                  \\,
                  f(\vec x)
